    "multicolumn_MLqYaL": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_bNLVja": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Myopia_Vision_Nearsighted_5979eb54-8ae9-446a-9765-e1a8ac20a2a5.png",
            "title": "<strong>Nearsighted/Shortsighted (Myopia)</strong>",
            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>If things in the distance look blurry, like coral reefs, fish, or boats, you’re likely nearsighted. Our minus (-) prescription lenses bring far-away details into focus, so you can see the underwater world clearly while still keeping close-up vision sharp.</p><p>About 1 in 3 Americans are Nearsighted!</p>",
            "link_label": "Shop Nearsighted Masks",
            "link": "shopify://collections/nearsighted-prescription-snorkel-masks"
          }
        },
        "column_3TXi83": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Hyperopia_Vision_Farsighted_f6ad7170-fd2a-497f-a156-687e5aeda32c.png",
            "title": "<strong>Farsighted (Hyperopia / Presbyopia)</strong>",
            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>If you see clearly far away but struggle to focus on things up close, like your gauges, camera, or the fish right in front of you, you’re likely farsighted. </p><p>Our plus (+) prescription lenses help bring everything into focus at once, making it easier to see clearly both near and far underwater.</p>",
            "link_label": "Shop Farsighted Masks",
            "link": "shopify://collections/farsighted-prescription-dive-mask"
          }
        },
        "column_E4Xn9K": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Normal_Vision_coral_reef.png",
            "title": "<strong>How Prescription Lenses Work Underwater</strong>",
            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>Whether your lenses are plus or minus, they simply adjust how light enters your eyes so everything, from nearby coral to the open blue, looks crisp and clear. </p><p><br/>Start seeing the reef and get your Prescription Snorkel/Dive Mask.</p>",
            "link_label": "Shop All Masks",
            "link": "shopify://collections/all-our-masks"
          }
        }
      },
